      },
      "reading": "RIK total-results reports are official materials of a state body; recorded as the owner-approved reading of the statute, weaker than a licence. The Act also grants a database-maker right (Art. 1, Art. 5a): only national totals of single official reports are transcribed, not a database extraction."
